{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Flaxxa Wapi — Public API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "summary": "WhatsApp Business API for messages, campaigns, contacts, and templates.",
    "description": "The Flaxxa Wapi Public API lets you send WhatsApp messages, manage contacts and\ngroups, create and trigger campaigns, and fetch templates — all programmatically.\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. Sign in at [wapi.flaxxa.com](https://wapi.flaxxa.com) and open **Brand → API Access**\n   to copy your **API token**.\n2. Pick an endpoint below. Every endpoint accepts your token as a parameter — see\n   *Authentication* for where it goes (body / query / form field).\n3. Try the cURL snippet from your terminal, or copy the JS / Python / PHP sample\n   into your own code.\n\n## Authentication\n\nEvery endpoint requires a `token` parameter. The location depends on the\nendpoint's content type:\n\n| Content type                | Where to put the token |\n|-----------------------------|------------------------|\n| `application/json` (POST)   | In the JSON body as `\"token\": \"...\"` |\n| Query string (GET)          | As `?token=...` |\n| `multipart/form-data` (POST)| As a form field named `token` |\n\nTokens are scoped to a single brand + phone number. Issue separate tokens for\neach brand you operate.\n\n## Base URL\n\n`https://wapi.flaxxa.com`\n\nAll paths below are appended to this base.\n\n## Conventions you'll see\n\n- **Endpoint name casing is inconsistent** (`Create_Campaign`, `CreateGroups`,\n  `Groups_contact`, `sendcampaigns`). These are intentional and preserved for\n  backwards compatibility — copy the exact path from each endpoint card.\n- **`campaing_id`** (yes, missing the second `g`) is the actual wire-format\n  field name on `POST /api/v1/sendcampaigns`. Preserved for compatibility.\n- Phone numbers are accepted in E.164 format (e.g. `+918470968883`); the leading\n  `+` is optional.\n- Timestamps in responses are MySQL `DATETIME` strings (UTC).\n\n## Rate limits\n\nThe default `api` throttle is **60 requests / minute / token**. Hitting it\nreturns `429 Too Many Requests` with a `Retry-After` header.\n\n## Errors\n\nEvery endpoint returns a JSON envelope:\n\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"error\", \"message\": \"Invalid API Token.\" }\n```\n\nCommon HTTP status codes:\n\n- `200` — success (status field will be `success` or similar)\n- `400` — request validation failed\n- `401` — invalid / missing / expired token\n- `403` — token is valid but plan doesn't include API access, or WhatsApp not configured\n- `429` — rate-limited\n- `5xx` — server error (please retry with exponential backoff)\n",
    "contact": {
      "name": "Flaxxa Wapi Support",
      "url": "https://wapi.flaxxa.com/support"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Proprietary",
      "url": "https://wapi.flaxxa.com"
    }
  },
  "externalDocs": {
    "description": "Flaxxa Wapi platform",
    "url": "https://wapi.flaxxa.com"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://wapi.flaxxa.com",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Messages",
      "description": "Send WhatsApp messages directly — either free-form (within a 24-hour customer\nwindow) or via approved templates. Attachment variants accept multipart uploads.\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "Templates",
      "description": "List the approved WhatsApp templates available to your brand."
    },
    {
      "name": "Contacts",
      "description": "Create and list contacts on your brand."
    },
    {
      "name": "Groups",
      "description": "Create groups, list groups, and add contacts to groups."
    },
    {
      "name": "Campaigns",
      "description": "Create campaigns from templates and trigger sends to groups."
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "tokenQuery": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "query",
        "name": "token",
        "description": "Use this scheme for GET endpoints and form-data endpoints (which can\naccept the token either as a query string parameter or as a form field).\nFor JSON POST endpoints, put the token inside the JSON body instead — see\neach endpoint's request body schema.\n"
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "TokenQuery": {
        "name": "token",
        "in": "query",
        "required": true,
        "description": "Your brand's API token.",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "example": "wefrwf4344243c23ec23c"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "error"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Invalid API Token."
          },
          "errors": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "description": "Field-level validation errors (only on 4xx where applicable)."
          }
        }
      },
      "Token": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Your brand's API token (issued from the Flaxxa Wapi dashboard).",
        "example": "wefrwf4344243c23ec23c"
      },
      "PhoneE164": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^\\+?[1-9][0-9]{6,14}$",
        "description": "Recipient phone number in E.164 format. Leading `+` is optional.\n",
        "example": "+918470968883"
      },
      "TemplateComponentParameter": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text",
              "currency",
              "date_time",
              "image",
              "video",
              "document",
              "payload",
              "PHONE_NUMBER",
              "URL",
              "QUICK_REPLY"
            ],
            "description": "Parameter type per Meta's\n[Cloud API spec](https://developers.facebook.com/docs/whatsapp/cloud-api/guides/send-message-templates).\n"
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Used when `type` is `text` (also as button label for PHONE_NUMBER / URL / QUICK_REPLY)."
          },
          "phone_number": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Used when `type` is `PHONE_NUMBER`."
          },
          "url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Used when `type` is `URL`."
          }
        }
      },
      "TemplateComponent": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "header",
              "body",
              "footer",
              "button"
            ]
          },
          "index": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Button index (0-based). Only used when `type` is `button`.",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "parameters": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TemplateComponentParameter"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "InlineButton": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "title"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "yes_12",
            "description": "Internal id you assign — included in webhook callbacks when the user taps."
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Yes",
            "description": "Button label visible to the recipient."
          }
        }
      },
      "SendMessageResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "success"
          },
          "message_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 28341,
            "description": "Internal Flaxxa Wapi message id (use with `get_message_response`)."
          },
          "message_wamid": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Meta WhatsApp message id (wamid).",
            "example": "wamid.HBgM..."
          }
        }
      },
      "MessageStatus": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "msg": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "id": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "value": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "error_details": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Template": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "One of `APPROVED`, `PENDING`, `REJECTED`."
          },
          "category": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "language": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "components": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Raw template components JSON (string-encoded)."
          },
          "company_id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Group": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "company_id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "deleted_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Contact": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "phone": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "avatar": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "country_id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "company_id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "deleted_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "last_reply_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "last_client_reply_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "last_support_reply_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "last_message": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "is_last_message_by_contact": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ]
          },
          "has_chat": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ]
          },
          "resolved_chat": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ]
          },
          "user_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "enabled_ai_bot": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              0,
              1
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "Campaign": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "template_id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "bot",
              "api",
              "regular"
            ]
          },
          "company_id": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "Invalid or missing API token.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            },
            "examples": {
              "invalidToken": {
                "value": {
                  "status": "error",
                  "message": "Invalid API Token."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Forbidden": {
        "description": "Token is valid but the plan doesn't include API access, or WhatsApp isn't configured for this brand.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            },
            "examples": {
              "noApiAccess": {
                "value": {
                  "status": "error",
                  "message": "Your Plan dont have access to API. Please upgrade your plan."
                }
              },
              "whatsappNotConfigured": {
                "value": {
                  "status": "error",
                  "message": "WhatsApp not configured yet. Please configure WhatsApp to use API."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "BadRequest": {
        "description": "Validation failed.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            },
            "examples": {
              "missingToken": {
                "value": {
                  "status": "error",
                  "errors": {
                    "token": [
                      "The token field is required."
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TooManyRequests": {
        "description": "Rate limit exceeded.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            },
            "examples": {
              "rateLimited": {
                "value": {
                  "status": "error",
                  "message": "Too Many Attempts."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "description": "Seconds until the limit window resets."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/sendmessage": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "summary": "Send a free-form WhatsApp message",
        "description": "Send a custom (non-template) message to a phone number. Optionally include\nreply buttons with a header and footer.\n\n**Important**: free-form messages can only be delivered if the recipient has\nreplied to your brand within the **last 24 hours**. Outside that window use\n`/api/v1/sendtemplatemessage` instead.\n",
        "operationId": "sendMessage",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "token",
                  "phone",
                  "message"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Token"
                  },
                  "phone": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PhoneE164"
                  },
                  "message": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "Do you like our service"
                  },
                  "header": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "Hello there",
                    "description": "Only applied when `buttons` is present."
                  },
                  "footer": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "Thanks",
                    "description": "Only applied when `buttons` is present."
                  },
                  "buttons": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "Up to 3 reply buttons.",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InlineButton"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "plain": {
                  "summary": "Plain text",
                  "value": {
                    "token": "wefrwf4344243c23ec23c",
                    "phone": "+918470968883",
                    "message": "Your order #1234 is confirmed."
                  }
                },
                "withButtons": {
                  "summary": "With reply buttons",
                  "value": {
                    "token": "wefrwf4344243c23ec23c",
                    "phone": "+918470968883",
                    "message": "Do you like our service?",
                    "header": "Hello there",
                    "footer": "Thanks",
                    "buttons": [
                      {
                        "id": "yes_12",
                        "title": "Yes"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "no_12",
                        "title": "No"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Message accepted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendMessageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/sendmessagewithattachment": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "summary": "Send a free-form message with a file attachment",
        "description": "Same as `sendmessage` but accepts a binary file (image / video / document)\nas `header_attachment`. Request must be `multipart/form-data`.\n",
        "operationId": "sendMessageWithAttachment",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "token",
                  "phone",
                  "header_attachment"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Token"
                  },
                  "phone": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PhoneE164"
                  },
                  "message": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "header": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "footer": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "buttons": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "JSON-encoded array of `{id, title}` button objects (string-form for multipart)."
                  },
                  "header_attachment": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary",
                    "description": "Image / video / document to attach to the message header."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Message accepted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendMessageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/sendtemplatemessage": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "summary": "Send a pre-approved template message",
        "description": "Sends a WhatsApp template message — used outside the 24-hour customer-reply\nwindow (e.g. for notifications, marketing, alerts). The template must be\nin `APPROVED` status (see `GET /api/v1/getTemplates`).\n\nThe `components` array follows Meta's official structure — see\n[Send Template Messages](https://developers.facebook.com/docs/whatsapp/cloud-api/guides/send-message-templates).\n",
        "operationId": "sendTemplateMessage",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "token",
                  "phone",
                  "template_name",
                  "template_language"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Token"
                  },
                  "phone": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PhoneE164"
                  },
                  "template_name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "order_confirmation"
                  },
                  "template_language": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "en_US"
                  },
                  "components": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TemplateComponent"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "bodyAndButtons": {
                  "summary": "Template with body variables + button overrides",
                  "value": {
                    "token": "{{token}}",
                    "phone": "+918470968883",
                    "template_name": "order_confirmation",
                    "template_language": "en_US",
                    "components": [
                      {
                        "type": "body",
                        "parameters": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Daniel"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "14"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "button",
                        "index": 0,
                        "parameters": [
                          {
                            "type": "PHONE_NUMBER",
                            "text": "call",
                            "phone_number": "+92897393793"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "URL",
                            "text": "Visit website",
                            "url": "https://www.webliska.com/"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "QUICK_REPLY",
                            "text": "purchase now"
                          },
                          {
                            "type": "QUICK_REPLY",
                            "text": "call us"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Template message accepted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendMessageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/sendtemplatemessage_withattachment": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "summary": "Send a template message with a file attachment",
        "description": "Same as `sendtemplatemessage` but accepts a binary file as\n`header_attachment` (used by templates whose header is `IMAGE`, `VIDEO`, or\n`DOCUMENT`). Request must be `multipart/form-data`.\n",
        "operationId": "sendTemplateMessageWithAttachment",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "token",
                  "phone",
                  "template_name",
                  "template_language",
                  "header_attachment"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "token": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Token"
                  },
                  "phone": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PhoneE164"
                  },
                  "template_name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "check_attachment"
                  },
                  "template_language": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "example": "en_US"
                  },
                  "components": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "JSON-encoded array of template components (string-form for multipart).",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "header_attachment": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary",
                    "description": "Header media (image / video / document) matching the template's header type."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Template message accepted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SendMessageResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/get_message_response": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Messages"
        ],
        "summary": "Fetch delivery status for a sent message",
        "description": "Returns the latest delivery state (`sent`, `delivered`, `read`, `failed`)\nand any error details for a previously-sent message. Wait at least **5\nseconds** after the send call before polling — Meta's delivery webhook\ntakes that long to arrive.\n",
        "operationId": "getMessageResponse",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
